'''Holy Knight Alibaba''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]]. [[True Form]] grants stat improvements, target [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]], and [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immunity]] but loses [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze Immunity]] and increases both cost and cooldown.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 556
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Holy Knight Alibaba
|name2 = Holy King Alibaba
|name3 = Ghost Alibaba
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Holy King Alibaba''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Ghost Alibaba''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Alibaba does a good job against Dark enemies, having Long Distance and massive damage against them. Although he gets severely outclassed by [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], especially if [[Talents|Talented]], he can still be useful in some instances, like in [[Bombergirl (Deadly)]]. The small inner range is its main issue, as Dark enemies easily push into it.

==='''True Form'''===
Ghost Alibaba is effective against Angels as well as Dark enemies. It stays at a safer distance while also having much better base stats, which, combined, allow him to snipe dangerous enemies such as [[Angelic Sleipnir|Sleipnir]], [[Chickful A]] and [[Le'noir]]. However, these improvements come with a huge price: Ghost Alibaba now has 40 seconds cooldown instead of 20 and its cost triples.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Midranger}}

